{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントくださった方！ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜが読んだのにもう一回よんだりして......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいことばかり!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドバイスを大切に読んで、\n少しずつ素敵なお姉ちゃんになるから待っててね〜！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとに皆さんはあたたかいから......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄くパワーもらったぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Thank Youです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問回答遅くなってごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構前のもあるけど、少しだけ質問返しです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ英検とかうけないの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ英検の予定はないけど、漢検の予定はありまふ！がんばりまふー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑタイトル募集してるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａあっ！まだやってますよ！コメントとかで言ってくだされば(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ今までお盆はどんなすごしかたしてたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａお墓前りとかかなぁ？家族と一緒に過ごしてたよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ生まあやみたいから仙台市にも、来てくれたらうれしいなあー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ仙台いきたいなぁー！おねぇーちゃんのヤマポテトといきたいなぁー！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑポテトはどうしてるんだろー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ飼い主ににていて元気ですよー！\nすぐに膝の上に来てくれて、かわいーよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑハングル文字の意味を教えてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ結構前のblogですよね？愛してる！っといういみです！照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ握手会で自転車の話でいぬのことはなしてたけどポテトのこと？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａちがいまーす！ずっと前からかってるミニチュアダックスのことです！名前はチョコ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑまあやに会いたいけどオジサンだからドン引きされそうで勇気が出ません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａえー？！次に来てもらえるの待ってまーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ山口に美味しいウニを食べに来て下さい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ山口でウニかってかえったよー！\nおいしかったぁー！山口だいすきー★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ夏休みの宿題は結局大丈夫だったの？再提出とかなかった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ大丈夫です！でも今年はギリギリで終わらせたから、とても焦りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上です！有り難う御座いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演の時の衣装なんで、ほぼ、写真の服が同じですね私......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、能條さんが凄くおかしいんですよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"腕に噛みついてきたり、凄い顔の近くで、唇を\n『ぶぅるるるぅぅぅ』\nってやってやってきたり......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、うれしいこともあるんです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪をきってから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『かわいーかわいーなんで貴方はヒヨコチャンみたいなのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていってくれるんですー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしーかぎりですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ可愛い♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！そして、今回のタイトルも、コメントにあった文章をタイトルにしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまり、まあや推しの人は、お面をかぶる人がいる！っということですよね!?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お面にまあやの名前が入っててびっくりしたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても嬉かった〜!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ握手会だ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったら、握手会の時コメントとかしてくださったりする皆さんお名前とか教えてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントや声援をもらってるから、まあやはパワー全開です!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１人１人に逢ってお礼を言える握手会が楽しみです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも逢えなくても心で繋がってる♪って思うと、恥ずかしいけど...めちゃくちゃ嬉しいです!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな気持ちに気付かせてくれて、\n本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん今日の夕飯はなんでした？\nちなみに私はチキンのトマトソ〜ス煮込みでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/14/5041187/0001.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}